2025-05-14
- tweaked CIA vs VBLANK heuristic:
-- now triggered if CIA modlen >= 8 minutes and selects whichever ever is shorter (matches openmpt and libxmp)
-- (previously trigger was >= 20 minutes and CIA modlen had to be 2x for VBLANK to get selected)
-- enforce CIA if Fxx used for both BPM and speed in same row (openmpt)
- enable VBLANK heuristic for "Protracker compatible" mods as well (AMP:Walkman/MOD.klisje paa klisje and others)
- use PTK1.1a replay mode when VBLANK detected

